  "scope": "24份淺灰連續高低輪廓的新手繪圖源，不推定材質身份；atlas_direct完整裁切，不作UV環繞或交界混合。",
  "master_alpha_contract": "opaque",
  "generation": {
    "tool": "built-in image_gen",
    "transparent_background": false,
    "prompt": "Edit reference1 into a clean production HD terrain atlas matching reference2's soft hand-painted RPG terrain style. Exact 1024x1536 canvas, four columns six rows, 24 equal256x256 cells. Reference1 is the precise native pale terrain geometry. Preserve EVERY cell's composition, bright raised surfaces, dark lower planes, shallow winding creases, distribution of broad rounded clusters, directional edges and cropped silhouettes at cell boundaries. Positions and apparent heights must follow the source. Each cell is independent in this atlas; do not invent one big scene crossing unrelated cells.\n\nUse a restrained pale desaturated mint-gray and gray-brown shadow palette matching source. Smooth larger hand-painted masses and softer natural rounded transitions, with low grain and restrained fine texture, following reference2. Keep real height and volume rather than flattening into a uniform noise texture. Keep all of the original highlights/dark planes recognizable. This is not ice, snow, water, tiles, architecture, roots, lava or crystals: do not add any inferred material-specific features. Describe only the visible rounded pale forms. Do not add trees, plants, objects, people, outlines, grid lines, borders, gaps, text or icons.\n\nReference2 supplies only rendering style; do NOT add its grass, earth, paths, hue, trees or scene composition. Keep reference1's original light gray-green hues and its orthographic view. No new artistic identities. Repaint the visible surfaces with clear broad low-noise planes. No pixel staircase edges, enlarged pixels, mosaic pattern, realistic micro-detail or photorealism.\n\nOutput one fully opaque RGBA atlas, exactly4x6 equal cells edge-to-edge, with no padding. Keep each original visible form clipped at exactly the same cell side, same size and location. We will cut the full cells, no recentering or UV wrapping.",
    "referenced_image_paths": [
      "original-24-reference.png",
      "docs/figures/hd1-terrain-redesign-style.png"
    ],
